            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Mai Anh",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nBasic street food\nAug 2022 • Couples\nService is fairly quick for the bun cha, you are given a mountain of noodles which you think you would never get through but manage it easily as you add handful after handful to the broth. Plenty of tasty pork pieces, option of additional garlic and chillies to flavour. Not a huge fan of the salad they add, I find it tastes too much like nettles. The lady asked us twice if we wanted a drink and we nodded both times but they never materialised. Paid 140 for two bun cha and a portion of spring rolls.\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2022",
